<title>USA: Fuisz Technologies head increases stake.</title>
<headline>Fuisz Technologies head increases stake.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuisz Technologies Ltd said Friday that chairman Richard Fuisz purchased 100,000 shares of the company's common stock in the open market at $5.875 a share.</p>
<p>The purchase increases the amount of securities Fuisz owns to 4,000,000 shares.</p>
<p>Fuisz Technologies develops drug delivery and food applications.</p>
</text>
